{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"alias":"fleece-grave-noolbenger","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Observation\n\nIn the last 40 failed CI runs (2026-10-23 to 2026-10-29), the `sweep (windows)` job failed `tests/unit/test_review_bot.py::test_lifespan_drains_queued_events_on_shutdown` 27 times with `RuntimeError: Network access is forbidden in unit/scripts tests`. Other lifespan tests in that module fail the same way in the same runs, for example in run 40797257532:\n- `test_lifespan_drain_is_bounded`\n- `test_shutdown_completes_an_in_flight_store_write_and_releases_the_lock`\n- `test_gerrit_internal_webhook_requires_the_gerrit_service_peer`\n\nOn Linux the same network attempt, `_current_revision` building a real `GerritClient`, is caught and the lookup fails open, so the error does not surface. Why it surfaces as the test failure on Windows has not been checked.\n\nThe same runs also show Windows-only failures unrelated to the network guard, for example `module 'signal' has no attribute 'SIGKILL'` and `State object has no attribute 'config'`.\n\n## Plan\n1. Read a Windows sweep log in full to find where the RuntimeError escapes, for example a call outside `_current_revision`'s try, or the reconcile loop.\n2. Check whether eastmost-uncheered-nematode's default stub of `_current_revision` removes these failures on the next Windows sweep.\n3. Fix the remaining escape, or skip POSIX-only tests on Windows the way fearful-valid-skua did, and give each skip its reason.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] The point where the RuntimeError escapes on Windows is identified and recorded on this ticket.\n- [ ] A scheduled `sweep (windows)` run after the fix shows no failure in tests/unit/test_review_bot.py. [non-codebase]\n  provenance: the GitHub Actions run id and its result, recorded on this ticket.\n\n## File impact (expected)\n- tests/unit/test_review_bot.py\n- tests/conftest.py","id":"35df-4dd8-1a02-40ef","parent_id":"","priority":3,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Windows sweep fails the review-bot lifespan tests with the network guard's RuntimeError"},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1793307558522533001,"uuid":"57740079-22b5-4e18-961c-3237eb6e3bfd"}